      "description": "<p>Hour-Aware Adaptive Risk Management for Autonomous Memecoin Trading: Companion Dataset + Manuscript Bundle (v1.1)</p>\n<p>Version 1.1 (2026-07-27). This is an earlier version of the companion bundle. The current version is v1.3 (2026-09-28); the concept DOI 10.5281/zenodo.20043301 always resolves to the latest version.</p>\n<p>Kamat, Arati Uday. Independent Researcher. ORCID 0009-0000-4781-312X.</p>\n<p>Companion deposit for Kamat (2026), a 15-day paper-traded deployment of an autonomous memecoin trading system on Solana decentralised exchanges (190 closed paper-trades and 4,874 post-rejection price samples, figures, manuscript files and a reproduction script).</p>\n<p>Companion preprints: SSRN 6564803, arXiv 2606.08232.</p>\n<p>Competing interests: the trading system is the subject of a pending U.S. provisional patent application (filed 2026-06-25, Micro Entity).</p>",
